    {
        "content": "<p><span class=\"user-mention silent\" data-user-id=\"123965\">Bryan Gin-ge Chen</span> <a href=\"#narrow/channel/595625-nightly-testing-mathlib/topic/crossrefs.20export.20failure/near/622997137\">said</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><span class=\"user-mention silent\" data-user-id=\"439514\">Marcelo Lynch</span> Looks like an error when getting the cache</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>Thanks. This is Azure being flaky. The <code>525</code> is being deliberately forwarded and curl treats it as non-retriable, but it is indeed flakiness, so I'll add it to the list of codes that are translated to a retriable 503</p>\n<p>Edit: done</p>",
