    {
        "content": "<p><span class=\"user-mention\" data-user-id=\"439514\">@Marcelo Lynch</span>, <span class=\"user-mention\" data-user-id=\"123965\">@Bryan Gin-ge Chen</span>, it looks like this is mint-token.py failing because of a transient error. Should we add a retry-with-backoff here?</p>",
        "id": 623921297,
        "sender_full_name": "Kim Morrison",
        "timestamp": 1789340434
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>E.g. <a href=\"https://github.com/leanprover-community/mathlib-ci/pull/75\">mathlib-ci#75</a> (happy if anyone wants to change the actual retry schedule, maybe minutes is more helpful than second!). It seems quite a few tools are exposed to a transient failure here.</p>",
        "id": 623921843,
        "sender_full_name": "Kim Morrison",
        "timestamp": 1789340833
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Thanks <span class=\"user-mention\" data-user-id=\"110087\">@Kim Morrison</span> ; I tweaked the code and docs a bit and added tests. I'll wait for another review from <span class=\"user-mention\" data-user-id=\"123965\">@Bryan Gin-ge Chen</span> before merging since I pushed</p>",
